---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;

const userStorage = [
  { label: t('用户一', 'User 1'), home: '97.1 GiB', docker: '10.7 GiB', total: '107.8 GiB', share: '24.7%' },
  { label: t('用户二', 'User 2'), home: '59.0 GiB', docker: '6.81 GiB', total: '65.8 GiB', share: '15.1%' },
  { label: t('用户三', 'User 3'), home: '17.1 GiB', docker: '5.13 GiB', total: '22.2 GiB', share: '5.1%' },
  { label: t('用户四', 'User 4'), home: '13.6 GiB', docker: '1.69 GiB', total: '15.3 GiB', share: '3.5%' },
  { label: t('用户五', 'User 5'), home: '4.42 GiB', docker: '3.39 GiB', total: '7.81 GiB', share: '1.8%' },
  { label: t('用户六', 'User 6'), home: '2.85 GiB', docker: '0.29 GiB', total: '3.14 GiB', share: '0.7%' },
  { label: t('用户七', 'User 7'), home: '<0.01 GiB', docker: '<0.01 GiB', total: '<0.01 GiB', share: '<0.1%' },
];

const refreshPrompt = t(
  `请刷新 BaseModel 服务器页面的空间使用快照。

目标页面：https://basemodel-preview.vercel.app/research/seed-openevo/flow/server/
仓库：mykcs/basemodel

请先读取仓库中的 docs/agents/current/server-storage-pressure-audit-sop.md，并按其中流程执行。

要求：
1. 先对共享实验服务器做只读空间审计，不要因为这条 Prompt 自动删除、清理、移动或重下载任何模型、checkpoint、run、缓存、容器或镜像。
2. 读取主文件系统的 total / used / available / Use%，再统计每个可识别账户的主目录占用。
3. 对 Docker 只统计能够通过 home mount 可靠归属到账户的 writable layer；共享镜像、build cache、volume、无法可靠归属的容器层和系统文件必须单独保留，不能按名字或标签强行分摊给某个人。
4. 所有账户按“主目录 + 可归属 Docker writable layer”的合计从大到小重新排序，只在公开页面写成“用户一、用户二……”；不要把任何账户单独标成“我们”，不要公开或持久化真实用户名、home 路径、容器名/ID、SSH 信息、IP、GPU UUID，也不要保存真实账户与匿名编号的映射。
5. 同时刷新页面上仍然需要的 CPU、RAM、GPU 库存事实；库存事实、实验分配和 GPU 使用授权必须分开。
6. 页面必须显示明确的 UTC+8 快照时间，并说明这是静态快照，不是实时监控。
7. 用本次实测数据更新中文和英文 server 页面及相关测试；不要从旧页面抄“当前”数字。
8. 修改后运行仓库要求的 deterministic Gate、build、overflow 和 UI/browser 验收；开 PR，确认 exact-head Preview 后合并到 main，并检查 Production 页面。

最后请汇报：本次快照时间、磁盘总量/已用/可用、匿名用户可归属总量、未归属 Docker 写入层、共享/系统占用、PR、merge commit 和 Production 验收结果。`,
  `Refresh the BaseModel server storage snapshot.

Target page: https://basemodel-preview.vercel.app/research/seed-openevo/flow/server/
Repository: mykcs/basemodel

Read docs/agents/current/server-storage-pressure-audit-sop.md first and follow that procedure.

Requirements:
1. Start with a read-only audit of the shared experiment server. This prompt does not authorize deleting, cleaning, moving, or redownloading models, checkpoints, runs, caches, containers, or images.
2. Measure total / used / available / Use% for the main filesystem, then measure each identifiable account home directory.
3. For Docker, attribute only writable layers that can be reliably tied to an account through its home mount. Keep shared images, build cache, volumes, unattributed container layers, and system files separate; never assign them to a person from names or labels.
4. Sort all accounts by attributable total (home + attributable Docker writable layer) and publish only temporary anonymous labels User 1, User 2, and so on. Do not single out any account as “ours.” Do not publish or persist usernames, home paths, container names/IDs, SSH details, IPs, GPU UUIDs, or the real-account-to-anonymous-label mapping.
5. Refresh any CPU, RAM, and GPU inventory facts that the page still needs. Keep server inventory, experiment allocation, and GPU authorization distinct.
6. Show an explicit UTC+8 snapshot time and state that this is a static snapshot, not live monitoring.
7. Update both Chinese and English server pages and related tests from the new measurements; do not copy “current” values from the old page.
8. Run the repository-required deterministic Gate, build, overflow, and UI/browser acceptance; open a PR, verify the exact-head Preview, merge to main, and verify Production.

Finally report the snapshot time, filesystem total/used/free, anonymous attributable totals, unattributed Docker writable layers, shared/system usage, PR, merge commit, and Production acceptance result.`
);

const gpuFacts = [
  { k: t('GPU 数量', 'GPU count'), v: '8 × RTX 5090' },
  { k: t('代际 / 架构', 'Generation / architecture'), v: 'GeForce RTX 50 · Blackwell' },
  { k: t('CUDA 核', 'CUDA cores'), v: '21,760 / GPU · 174,080 total' },
  { k: t('显存', 'VRAM'), v: '32,607 MiB / GPU · ≈ 254.7 GiB total' },
  { k: 'Compute Capability', v: '12.0' },
  { k: t('驱动快照', 'Driver snapshot'), v: '610.57.04' },
];
---
<main class="server-overview" data-locale={locale}>
  <header class="server-hero">
    <div class="server-hero__eyebrow">{t('OpenEvo / WebShop · 实验服务器', 'OpenEvo / WebShop · experiment server')}</div>
    <h1>{t('实验服务器简介', 'Experiment server overview')}</h1>
    <p>{t('2026-09-03 的服务器库存快照显示，这台机器有 2 × Intel Xeon Platinum 8380、约 1.0 TiB 内存，并可见 8 × RTX 5090。同期存储快照中，主文件系统约有 25.1 GiB 可用；磁盘空间仍是当前最紧张的资源。', 'The 2026-09-03 server inventory snapshot shows 2 × Intel Xeon Platinum 8380 CPUs, about 1.0 TiB RAM, and 8 visible RTX 5090 GPUs. The storage snapshot from the same check shows about 25.1 GiB free on the main filesystem, so disk capacity remains the tightest resource.')}</p>
    <div class="snapshot-note">
      <strong>{t('数据时间', 'Data timestamp')}</strong>
      <span>2026-09-03 01:11 (UTC+8)</span>
      <span>{t('静态快照，不是实时监控面板', 'Static snapshot, not a live monitoring dashboard')}</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="priority-grid" aria-label={t('关键资源', 'Key resources')}>
    <article class="priority-card priority-card--attention">
      <span>{t('磁盘剩余', 'Disk free')}</span>
      <strong>25.1 GiB</strong>
      <h2>{t('主文件系统可用空间', 'Main filesystem available')}</h2>
      <p>{t('本次存储快照中，df 报告 94% 已使用。大 checkpoint、共享 Docker/容器层或重复实验副本仍可能很快把它推满。', 'In this storage snapshot, df reports 94% used. Large checkpoints, shared Docker/container layers, or duplicate experiment copies can still fill it quickly.')}</p>
    </article>
    <article class="priority-card">
      <span>GPU</span>
      <strong>8 × 5090</strong>
      <h2>GeForce RTX 50 · Blackwell</h2>
      <p>{t('每张约 31.8 GiB 显存。8 张卡的显存不能自动当成一张 254.7 GiB 的大卡，是否能合并使用取决于并行策略。', 'Each GPU has about 31.8 GiB VRAM. Eight GPUs do not automatically behave like one 254.7 GiB GPU; usable aggregate memory depends on the parallelism strategy.')}</p>
    </article>
    <article class="priority-card">
      <span>CPU</span>
      <strong>80 / 160</strong>
      <h2>{t('80 个物理核 · 160 个逻辑线程', '80 physical cores · 160 logical threads')}</h2>
      <p>2 × Intel Xeon Platinum 8380 @ 2.30 GHz · 40 {t('核/路', 'cores/socket')} · 2 {t('线程/核', 'threads/core')}</p>
    </article>
    <article class="priority-card">
      <span>RAM</span>
      <strong>1.0 TiB</strong>
      <h2>{t('内存容量', 'System memory')}</h2>
      <p>{t('快照时约 65.8 GiB 正在使用，Linux 报告约 926.5 GiB available；RAM 远比磁盘宽裕。', 'At the snapshot, about 65.8 GiB was in use and Linux reported about 926.5 GiB available; RAM is far less constrained than disk.')}</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="server-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span>01</span>
      <div>
        <small>{t('存储', 'Storage')}</small>
        <h2>{t('磁盘使用情况', 'Filesystem usage')}</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="section-lede">{t('主文件系统总容量约 436.0 GiB。本次快照已用 388.7 GiB，df 报 94% 使用率，普通写入约剩 25.1 GiB。能按账户可靠归属的部分单独计算；共享 Docker 镜像和系统占用不强行分摊给任何个人。', 'The main filesystem has about 436.0 GiB of total capacity. This snapshot shows 388.7 GiB used, df at 94%, and about 25.1 GiB available for ordinary writes. Usage that can be reliably tied to an account is counted separately; shared Docker images and system usage are not forced onto an individual.')}</p>

    <div class="storage-status">
      <div class="storage-status__numbers">
        <div><span>{t('文件系统', 'Filesystem')}</span><strong>436.0 GiB</strong></div>
        <div><span>{t('已用', 'Used')}</span><strong>388.7 GiB</strong></div>
        <div><span>{t('可用', 'Available')}</span><strong>25.1 GiB</strong></div>
        <div><span>df Use%</span><strong>94%</strong></div>
      </div>
      <div class="storage-bar" role="img" aria-label={t('436.0 GiB 主文件系统：可按账户归属的主目录与 Docker 写入层合计 222.0 GiB；无法归属到具体账户的 Docker 写入层 19.0 GiB；其余共享与系统占用 147.7 GiB；可用 25.1 GiB；文件系统保留与舍入 22.2 GiB。', '436.0 GiB main filesystem: 222.0 GiB is attributable to accounts through home directories plus Docker writable layers; 19.0 GiB is Docker writable-layer usage not attributable to a specific account; 147.7 GiB is other shared/system usage; 25.1 GiB is available; 22.2 GiB is filesystem reserve/rounding.') }>
        <span class="storage-bar__users" style="width:50.9%"></span>
        <span class="storage-bar__docker" style="width:4.4%"></span>
        <span class="storage-bar__shared" style="width:33.9%"></span>
        <span class="storage-bar__free" style="width:5.7%"></span>
        <span class="storage-bar__reserved" style="width:5.1%"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="storage-legend">
        <div><i class="legend-swatch legend-swatch--users"></i><span>{t('可按账户归属', 'Account-attributed')}</span><strong>222.0 GiB · 50.9%</strong></div>
        <div><i class="legend-swatch legend-swatch--docker"></i><span>{t('未归属 Docker 写入层', 'Unattributed Docker writable layers')}</span><strong>19.0 GiB · 4.4%</strong></div>
        <div><i class="legend-swatch legend-swatch--shared"></i><span>{t('共享 / 系统占用', 'Shared / system usage')}</span><strong>147.7 GiB · 33.9%</strong></div>
        <div><i class="legend-swatch legend-swatch--free"></i><span>{t('可用空间', 'Available')}</span><strong>25.1 GiB · 5.7%</strong></div>
        <div><i class="legend-swatch legend-swatch--reserved"></i><span>{t('文件系统保留 / 舍入', 'Filesystem reserve / rounding')}</span><strong>22.2 GiB · 5.1%</strong></div>
      </div>
      <p class="fine-print">{t('“可按账户归属”只把主目录和能够通过容器 home 挂载明确关联到该账户的 Docker 写入层相加。共享 Docker 镜像、构建缓存和系统文件不会因为方便统计就分摊给某个用户。所有百分比均以 436.0 GiB 总容量为分母。', '“Account-attributed” adds only home-directory usage and Docker writable layers that can be tied to an account through its home mount. Shared Docker images, build cache, and system files are not assigned to a user just to make the totals look complete. All percentages use 436.0 GiB total capacity as the denominator.')}</p>
      <div class="why-df">
        <strong>{t('为什么 df 显示 94%', 'Why df reports 94%')}</strong>
        <p>{t('df 的 94% 不是简单的 388.7 ÷ 436.0，因为文件系统会保留一部分空间；普通写入当前约有 25.1 GiB。', 'The 94% shown by df is not simply 388.7 ÷ 436.0 because the filesystem reserves part of its capacity; about 25.1 GiB is currently available for ordinary writes.')}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-df">
        <strong>{t('共享 Docker 不能按名字分摊', 'Shared Docker is not assigned by name')}</strong>
        <p>{t('镜像层、build cache 和部分容器层属于共享 daemon。镜像名、容器标签或某次任务路径看起来像某个账户，不代表整份共享镜像都属于该账户。', 'Image layers, build cache, and some container layers belong to the shared daemon. An image name, container label, or task path that looks associated with one account does not make the entire shared image that account’s usage.')}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="server-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span>02</span>
      <div>
        <small>{t('账户占用', 'Account usage')}</small>
        <h2>{t('各用户磁盘占用', 'Disk usage by account')}</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="section-lede">{t('每个账户的“可归属合计” = 主目录 + 与该账户 home 挂载关联的 Docker 写入层。Docker 写入层是容器内部新增、还没有算进主目录的文件；共享镜像不属于某一个用户。', 'Each account’s “attributable total” equals its home directory plus Docker writable layers tied to that account’s home mount. A writable layer contains files added inside a container that are not part of the home directory; shared images do not belong to one user.')}</p>
    <div class="storage-table-wrap" role="region" aria-label={t('匿名账户磁盘占用表', 'Anonymized account disk-usage table')} tabindex="0">
      <table class="storage-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">{t('账户', 'Account')}</th>
            <th scope="col">{t('主目录', 'Home directory')}</th>
            <th scope="col">{t('Docker 写入层', 'Docker writable layers')}</th>
            <th scope="col">{t('可归属合计', 'Attributable total')}</th>
            <th scope="col">{t('全盘占比', 'Share of filesystem')}</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {userStorage.map((item) => (
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">{item.label}</th>
              <td>{item.home}</td>
              <td>{item.docker}</td>
              <td><strong>{item.total}</strong></td>
              <td>{item.share}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="fine-print">{t('用户一到七是 2026-09-03 01:11（UTC+8）快照中按“可归属合计”从大到小重新生成的临时匿名标签，不是公开身份，也不会跨快照保持同一个编号。网页不保存真实账户与匿名编号之间的对应关系。', 'Users 1–7 are temporary anonymous labels regenerated from attributable-total ranking in the 2026-09-03 01:11 (UTC+8) snapshot. They are not public identities and the numbering does not persist across snapshots. The page does not store the mapping between real accounts and anonymous labels.')}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="server-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span>03</span>
      <div>
        <small>GPU</small>
        <h2>{t('GPU 规格', 'GPU specifications')}</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="section-lede">{t('RTX 5090 属于 GeForce RTX 50 系列，采用 Blackwell 架构。单卡 21,760 个 CUDA 核，显存 32,607 MiB，Compute Capability 为 12.0。', 'RTX 5090 belongs to the GeForce RTX 50 series and uses the Blackwell architecture. Each GPU has 21,760 CUDA cores, 32,607 MiB VRAM, and Compute Capability 12.0.')}</p>
    <dl class="gpu-facts">
      {gpuFacts.map((item) => <div><dt>{item.k}</dt><dd>{item.v}</dd></div>)}
    </dl>
    <div class="gpu-note">
      <strong>{t('多卡性能说明', 'Multi-GPU performance note')}</strong>
      <p>{t('8 张卡 × 21,760 CUDA 核可以得到整机 174,080 CUDA 核这个“规格总和”，但训练速度不会简单变成单卡的 8 倍。数据并行、模型并行、通信和显存分配都会决定实际收益。', 'Eight cards × 21,760 CUDA cores gives a hardware-spec total of 174,080 CUDA cores, but training does not automatically become eight times faster. Data/model parallelism, communication, and memory placement determine the real gain.')}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="server-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span>04</span>
      <div>
        <small>{t('快捷操作', 'Quick action')}</small>
        <h2>{t('刷新服务器空间快照', 'Refresh the server storage snapshot')}</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="section-lede">{t('这个 Prompt 用来把当前页面的刷新流程带到新的 ChatGPT 对话里。复制后直接发送即可；它默认只做只读审计和网页更新，不授权清理服务器文件。', 'This prompt carries the page-refresh workflow into a new ChatGPT conversation. Copy and send it directly; by default it authorizes only a read-only audit and webpage update, not server cleanup.')}</p>
    <div class="refresh-prompt">
      <pre data-copy-label={t('复制刷新 Prompt', 'Copy refresh prompt')}><code>{refreshPrompt}</code></pre>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="server-section server-section--privacy">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span>05</span>
      <div>
        <small>{t('隐私边界', 'Privacy boundary')}</small>
        <h2>{t('资源归属与隐私', 'Usage attribution and privacy')}</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="privacy-grid">
      <div>
        <strong>{t('公开展示', 'Shown publicly')}</strong>
        <p>{t('总容量、总占用、可用空间、GPU 型号与数量，以及按可归属总量排序的匿名“用户一、用户二……”、主目录与 Docker 写入层大小。匿名编号只对应 2026-09-03 01:11（UTC+8）这次快照，不保存身份映射。', 'Total capacity, total usage, free space, GPU model/count, anonymous users ranked by attributable total, and the home-directory/Docker writable-layer split. Anonymous numbering applies only to the 2026-09-03 01:11 (UTC+8) snapshot, and no identity mapping is stored.')}</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>{t('不公开', 'Not shown')}</strong>
        <p>{t('用户名、容器名、容器 ID、GPU 进程命令、GPU UUID、IP、SSH 别名、匿名编号映射或任何可反查身份的信息。', 'Usernames, container names/IDs, GPU process commands, GPU UUIDs, IPs, SSH aliases, anonymous-label mappings, or other identity-revealing details.')}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <details class="measurement-notes">
    <summary>{t('数据来源', 'Data sources')}</summary>
    <p>{t('主文件系统来自 df -B1 /；可识别账户的主目录来自只读 du；Docker 写入层来自容器 size 信息，并通过容器挂载到的 home 目录做匿名归属；无法可靠归属的容器写入层保留为单独一项。Docker system df 只用于汇总共享镜像、容器、卷和 build cache，不把共享镜像强行分摊给个人。CPU / GPU 规格沿用已核验的硬件配置。页面只保存匿名后的容量数字，不保存用户名、SSH 地址、GPU UUID、容器名、容器 ID 或匿名编号映射。', 'The main filesystem comes from df -B1 /; home-directory sizes for identifiable accounts come from read-only du measurements; Docker writable-layer sizes come from container size data and are anonymized by the home directory mounted into each container. Writable layers that cannot be reliably tied to an account remain separate. Docker system df is used only for shared image/container/volume/build-cache totals; shared images are not forced onto individual users. CPU/GPU specifications remain the previously verified hardware configuration. The page stores only anonymized capacity figures, not usernames, SSH endpoints, GPU UUIDs, container names/IDs, or the anonymous-label mapping.')}</p>
  </details>
</main>

<style>
  .server-overview{color:var(--ink)}
  .server-hero{max-width:930px;padding:clamp(1.4rem,4vw,3rem) 0 1.35rem}
  .server-hero__eyebrow{color:var(--accent-deep);font:800 .68rem/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.08em}
  .server-hero h1{max-width:18ch;margin:.55rem 0 .8rem;font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,4.2rem);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.055em}
  .server-hero>p{max-width:72ch;margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.02rem;line-height:1.75}
  .snapshot-note{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.45rem .75rem;align-items:center;margin-top:1rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.72rem}
  .snapshot-note strong{color:var(--ink)}
  .snapshot-note span+span{padding-left:.75rem;border-left:1px solid var(--line)}

  .priority-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.75rem;margin:1rem 0 3.5rem}
  .priority-card{min-height:220px;padding:1.15rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;background:var(--surface)}
  .priority-card--attention{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent-deep) 48%,var(--line));background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 8%,var(--surface))}
  .priority-card>span{display:block;color:var(--muted);font:800 .62rem/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .priority-card>strong{display:block;margin:.8rem 0 .3rem;font-size:clamp(1.85rem,3vw,3rem);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.055em}
  .priority-card h2{margin:.2rem 0 .75rem;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.35}
  .priority-card p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.65}

  .server-section{padding:2.4rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .section-heading{display:flex;gap:.8rem;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:1rem}
  .section-heading>span{padding-top:.2rem;color:var(--accent-deep);font:800 .68rem/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}
